formula \n\n$$\n{C}^{k}=P{D}^{k}{P}^{-1}.\n$$\n\nCarrying out the necessary multiplication, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}^{36} & =P{D}^{36}{P}^{-1} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}]{[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[18]{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt[36]{3}\\end{aligned}]}^{36}(\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}(\\sqrt[18]{3})^{36} & 0 \\\\ 0 & (\\sqrt[36]{3})^{36}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{3}^{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & {3}^{1}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}9 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}27 & -3 \\\\ -27 & 6\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}15 & 6 \\\\ -12 & -3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-140132/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "634729e9-7633-52d8-99fa-b00fc9cbe96a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140132"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-86682/selection/6de62cb3ec4c23ab8dfebb5bc2d3a517d4c0a6563c0ff90e0d5dd96e2d3c00f0" :answer/id #uuid "6a9d3324-8234-54fe-b58e-dbb51241f6c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86682/selection/4854cffa738ebda02e68190c7689cf2dc5b5e72f6861d916698ac19e6ece64b4" :answer/id #uuid "78dc6699-9160-5797-98bc-848c8c7ecfc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86682/selection/ceac